BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:reynard-0.19.0@omnisource
DTSTAMP:20261026T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261026
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261027
SUMMARY:Reynard v0.19.0
DESCRIPTION:Reynard 0.19.0 | Reynard\n\n## Changes\n\n**Full Changelog**: h
 ttps://github.com/minh-ton/reynard-browser/compare/0.18.0...0.19.0\n\n### 
 New Features\n- Added support for game controllers.\n- You can now import 
 and export your bookmarks\, history\, and add-ons:\n  - Bookmarks can be i
 mported from and exported to other browsers as an HTML file.\n  - History 
 can be imported from Safari or Google Takeout (Chrome)\, and exported in S
 afari's format.\n  - Add-ons can be imported from and exported to another 
 Reynard install.\n\n### Bug Fixes & Improvements\n- Webpages that fail to 
 load now show an error page explaining what went wrong\, with options to t
 ry again or go back.\n- You can now right-click a Favorite site on the hom
 epage using a pointer device to reveal its context menu.\n- Fixed an issue
  where pull to refresh would occasionally get stuck\, with the refresh spi
 nner appearing indefinitely.\n- Fixed numerous UI issues.\n\n### Engine\n\
 nUpdated Gecko to [158.0.1](https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/com
 mit/FIREFOX_158_0_1_RELEASE) (released Oct 20\, 2026).
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/reynard.json
END:VEVENT
