 n OpenWebUI/chat by @dalgibbard in https://github.com/cogwheel0/conduit/pu
 ll/869\n* Open the Android assistant on a ready new chat\, and keep it aft
 er a reboot by @cogwheel0 in https://github.com/cogwheel0/conduit/pull/872
