 it is transcribing by @cogwheel0 in https://github.com/cogwheel0/conduit/p
 ull/873\n* Make the progressive-replacement cadence test independent of ti
 ming by @cogwheel0 in https://github.com/cogwheel0/conduit/pull/877\n* Clo
 se the sidebar when a share opens chat on a phone by @cogwheel0 in https:/
 /github.com/cogwheel0/conduit/pull/878\n* List a server under its new addr
 ess once its old one is edited by @cogwheel0 in https://github.com/cogwhee
 l0/conduit/pull/884\n* Offer the reasoning-effort picker to every model\, 
 send it on explicit opt-in by @michaw23 in https://github.com/cogwheel0/co
 nduit/pull/871\n* Share an image from Safari's long-press menu to Conduit 
 as the image by @cogwheel0 in https://github.com/cogwheel0/conduit/pull/88
 5\n* Keep long-message context menu actions visible on iOS by @kapily in h
