SUMMARY:Apollo v4.0.0
DESCRIPTION:Apollo 4.0.0 | Apollo-Reborn-4.0.0\n\n### Features\n\n- Add **i
 Phone Duo** support with layouts that adapt to the closed display\, open p
 ortrait\, open landscape and partially folded positions\, using the existi
 ng Apollo Reborn builds (#1245: @IllIIllIllIllII)\n  - Browse a feed besid
 e its comments\, choose Original or Focused content widths\, and open the 
 subreddit list in a Standard or Liquid Glass panel\n  - Inbox\, Account an
 d Settings gain sidebar/detail layouts in open landscape\, while Search ca
 n keep results beside the page you open\n  - Pixel Pals is unavailable on 
 Duo\; regular iPhones keep it\n- Add an optional **iPad Layout (Beta)** on
  iPadOS 18 and later\, with a native sidebar\, adjustable feed and reader 
 columns\, and full-width Gallery View (#1385: @jordanearle)\n  - Try it fr
 om the one-time invitation or turn on iPad Layout under Interface\; quit a
 nd reopen Apollo to apply it\, or turn it off to return to the classic lay
 out\n- Add **Restore Reading Session** to reopen your last feed\, post and
  nearby reading position after iOS closes Apollo\, including feed and comm
 ent sorting (#1441: @Thetromboneman1)\n  - On by default under Media → B
 rowsing\; explicit links and notifications take priority\, and turning it 
 off deletes the saved session\n- Add a **Setup Assistant** for new install
 ations to connect or restore\, choose Classic\, Balanced or Full Featured 
 preferences\, select appearance\, and review before applying (#1401: @jord
 anearle)\n  - Existing users can open it from Apollo Reborn settings with 
 Keep My Settings selected\; updating does not automatically apply a preset
 \n- Rework **Gallery View** with faster opening\, pinch-to-resize tiles in
 cluding a denser four-column layout\, and native press-and-hold menus in t
 he grid and fullscreen viewer (#1389\, #1434: @icpryde\, @IllIIllIllIllII)
 \n  - Sports clips can play silently in the grid\, newly visible tiles sta
 rt reliably\, and returning from a fullscreen image no longer leaves a bla
 ck screen\n- Open **Gallery View** for All Saved or a selec
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/apollo.json
