 synced line changes with a spring scroll\n- **haptics**: Render music puls
 es on basic motors and add tuning sliders\n- **downloads**: Embed enriched
  artwork across audio formats\n- **artwork**: Read padded ID3 covers and r
 epair cached previews\n- **crash**: Exclude system memory kills from crash
  notices\n- **backup**: Reconcile restored iOS paths before publishing his
 tory\n- **library**: Release network scan memory and cancel active metadat
 a reads\n- **android**: Apply renderer compatibility before shared engine 
 creation\n\n### Performance\n\n- **ui**: Improve Material and Mornye playe
 r and library smoothness\n- **library**: Cache unchanged SMB and WebDAV sc
 an metadata\n\n### Documentation\n\n- **readme**: Remove Related Projects 
 section\n- **readme**: Drop heading anchors from feature cards\n\n### Chor
 es\n\n- Update AltStore source to v5.2.0 by [@github-actions[bot]](https:/
 /github.com/github-actions[bot])\n- **branding**: Drop rem
