DESCRIPTION:Eclipse 2.3.0 | Eclipse-unsigned-v2.3.0-20261020-090254\n\nAddi
 tions:\n\n-Deep tracker library integration option (AniList\, MAL\, Trakt)
 \n-Simkl Tracking (Will NOT get deep tracking integration due to free tier
  limits)\n-Ratings and Notes setting\n-Concurrent download controls\n-Back
 ground HLS downloading (iOS 26+ only)\n-Subtitle delay\n-Dolby Atmos and D
 olby Vision support\n-epub support (experimental)\n-Light novel reader rew
 ork\n\nFixes/Changes (fixes are not guaranteed\, different devices behave 
 differently) :\n\n-Fixed mpv backgrounding audio desync\, it should take a
  sec to recover.\n-Fixed mpv downstream blowing up\n-Changed Alt poster an
 d season building to be more accurate\, tested 220 anime\, and 100 western
  shows\n-Fixed unaired episode hiding\n-Fixed System calendar crash\, app 
 now enforces Gregorian calendar\n-Fixed Ratings and Notes getting lost\n-R
 emoved Performance mode and watch together. No longer needed/wasn't popula
 r. Perf mode is enforced On\n-Ratings and notes can now be assigned per se
 ason rather than the whole show\n-Subtitle edit fixes\n-Language filters a
 re now hardcoded values instead of user inputted ones\n-Fixed Reader mode 
 library importing not being able to connect a source\n-Rearranged settings
  to push more important ones higher\n-Changed some Auto Mode logic\n-Fixed
  audio name detection\n-Fixed subtitle name detection\n-Double tap to seek
  no longer brings up the player UI\n\nAs always\, use GitHub issues or the
  discord for requests or bug reports.
