SUMMARY:Reynard v0.18.0
DESCRIPTION:Reynard 0.18.0 | Reynard\n\n## Changes\n\n**Full Changelog**: h
 ttps://github.com/minh-ton/reynard-browser/compare/0.17.1...0.18.0\n\n### 
 New Features\n- When a webpage uses a keyboard shortcut that conflicts wit
 h one of the app's\, the first press now goes to the webpage\, and a hint 
 appears in the address bar letting you press the shortcut again to trigger
  the app's.\n\n### Improvements\n- Scrolling on webpages is now smoother a
 nd more accurate.\n- Improved audio handling\, with better echo cancellati
 on\, voice processing\, recovery after interruptions\, and handling of aud
 io device changes.\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- Fixed an issue where keyboard short
 cuts would not be recognized by websites after using Find in Page or a `<s
 elect>` element.\n- Fixed an issue where the image preview and its actions
  would not work on certain images\, such as those requiring authentication
  or in the WebP format.\n- Fixed an issue where tapping the status bar to 
 scroll to the top would not scroll completely to the top of the webpage wh
 en using the top address bar.\n- Fixed an issue where touches on some webp
 ages would land in the wrong place.\n- Added small performance improvement
 s and fixed several UI issues.\n\n### Engine\n\nUpdated Gecko to [158.0](h
 ttps://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/commit/FIREFOX_158_0_RELEASE) (r
 eleased Oct 13\, 2026).
