DESCRIPTION:Jellify 1.3.0 | Jellify-1.3.0\n\nWelcome to Jellify 1.3.0\n\nHe
 y music lovers! We've packed this update with some really sweet fixes and 
 major stability improvements to make sure your playlist keeps going strong
  wherever you are. Grab your headphones and get ready to stream!\n\n*   **
 Improved Car Experience:** We've made some great updates for Android Auto 
 users\, giving you server-backed browsing and a much smoother experience w
 hen resuming playback in your car.\n*   **Flawless Playback:** We tackled 
 some lingering glitches\, including better buffering and fixes to the main
  player screen. Now your music should stream more reliably\, even when swi
 tching between tracks or listening on the go.\n*   **Enhanced Stability on
  All Platforms:** This update includes better organization for music album
 s and fixes a small issue on iOS where the player dismiss gesture wasn't w
 orking correctly.
