BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:reynard-0.17.0@omnisource
DTSTAMP:20261011T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
SUMMARY:Reynard v0.17.0
DESCRIPTION:Reynard 0.17.0 | Reynard\n\n## Changes\n\n**Full Changelog**: h
 ttps://github.com/minh-ton/reynard-browser/compare/0.16.0...0.17.0\n\n### 
 Improvements\n- The native text input integration has been rewritten from 
 scratch\, so typing now feels truly native\, supports nearly all iOS text 
 editing behaviors\, and is significantly more stable.\n\n### New Features\
 n- The address bar now automatically focuses for input on new tab pages wh
 en using a physical keyboard.\n- You can now cycle between tabs using the 
 Ctrl + Tab and Shift + Ctrl + Tab keyboard shortcuts.\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- 
 Fixed an issue where a tab would appear blank after closing another tab in
  the tab overview.\n- Fixed an issue where dragging the iPad floating keyb
 oard or shortcut bar would push the web view upward.\n- Fixed an issue whe
 re taps would sometimes land in the wrong spot on some iframe elements whe
 n the scroll to hide toolbar is enabled.\n- Fixed several UI issues.\n\n##
 # Engine\n\nUpdated Gecko to [157.0.1](https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/
 firefox/commit/FIREFOX_157_0_1_RELEASE) (released Oct 6\, 2026).
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/reynard.json
END:VEVENT
